 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_8bb0f2aa16ee91db15ad",
   "sourceHash": "8bb0f2aa16ee91db15ad45e65b64d0c0905d50f83118ed526364bd0e03bb4a6c",
   "text": "Consult-/therapiemoment: traditionele behandelingen zoals voorgeschreven",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_034ae7e67c8d956c2190",
   "sourceHash": "034ae7e67c8d956c219044aa5731d3ed0ac76a1f62b147f66bec8a30c4c09956",
   "text": "Door een arts begeleide therapeutische sessies, afgestemd op uw specifieke welzijnsbehoeften en constitutie.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_38c5a40f576b1d49bc02",
   "sourceHash": "38c5a40f576b1d49bc0295c947b3d92077d80f1cee878d0e6f52855e19812059",
   "text": "Middag: gepersonaliseerde ayurvedische maaltijden + rust",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e648e952d17f045032ed",
   "sourceHash": "e648e952d17f045032edff48982b50f65263657f88a4dc7c98bda2bbc281d8f0",
   "text": "Voedzame maaltijden afgestemd op uw programma, gevolgd door herstellende rust en tijd voor de spijsvertering.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b3ca32606b0f23c88c2f",
   "sourceHash": "b3ca32606b0f23c88c2fa0d16b6b83be37a680183e2f4d3581fed43ab25fcec8",
   "text": "Neem deel aan een welzijnsworkshop of een educatieve sessie over ayurveda en gezond leven.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b9cec36ef2cad3795d9c",
   "sourceHash": "b9cec36ef2cad3795d9c37a03a6404dd3ac92eeaff3ba5be05dc1b13daac23ee",
   "text": "Avond: zachte beweging/meditatie + vroeg tot rust komen",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b96dc5ce7bd37b7aa88",
   "sourceHash": "4b96dc5ce7bd37b7aa888a5c861105cbd8ebb626a813a31b7b7367ab491af230",
   "text": "Kalmerende oefeningen en ondersteunende routines die uw lichaam voorbereiden op een diepe, herstellende slaap.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_170ebbe04caee35d707f",
   "sourceHash": "170ebbe04caee35d707f7181292180c554feca1270c53557879e32ffc0c106a3",
   "text": "Nacht: ondersteunende routine voor diepere slaap en herstel",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6344757f3ece374f9a92",
   "sourceHash": "6344757f3ece374f9a92cd4ab57e22c7343fc2e7a5d0f274c1823c21d7fce3f3",
   "text": "Sluit uw dag af met rituelen die diepe rust en nachtelijke verjonging bevorderen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1c6c48b57ff127ba3eac",
   "sourceHash": "1c6c48b57ff127ba3eac43e08d88d3983d57a01476f4720106f48eb1ff398c30",
   "text": "Uw routine kan variëren afhankelijk van uw constitutie (Prakriti) en programmadoelen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bb4e39a5b363e618edfe",
   "sourceHash": "bb4e39a5b363e618edfed7c1164de9a31cd476af8d99c773f8585d1492480490",
   "text": "Het Maharaja Club-verschil bij Kairali",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_93b15f28e385f7d5b439",
   "sourceHash": "93b15f28e385f7d5b439fefbfbf6610c17c364f49227383778a6979a35bb330b",
   "text": "Exclusieve voordelen voor leden van de Air India Maharaja Club.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dbabaae117d80aa8d001",
   "sourceHash": "dbabaae117d80aa8d0017dc21098936d26a3499f8a62df6c74a8f83d100ad555",
   "text": "Vertrouwde excellentie",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1cd5f19c97c4a3808354",
   "sourceHash": "1cd5f19c97c4a38083540b351a09aa42ac08c0451e67e452349ddbbfdf13b1ce",
   "text": "NABH-geaccrediteerde instelling in een serene omgeving. Meer dan 118 jaar erfgoed en meer dan 500 succesverhalen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_99c06646235c8b100e5e",
   "sourceHash": "99c06646235c8b100e5e127e5ebe3cba2049dcb40f592b8dc7eec560a0d2d4ca",
   "text": "Gepersonaliseerde heling",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0eb895ae08f67a936d77",
   "sourceHash": "0eb895ae08f67a936d77f88b417013b6cbf81f00d0e42f5fc6b597043046d7b1",
   "text": "De Prakriti-beoordeling bepaalt uw hele verblijf — elke behandeling, maaltijd en activiteit sluit aan op uw unieke lichaamsconstitutie.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bfdae037429919a8dd88",
   "sourceHash": "bfdae037429919a8dd880cc6a8a0aa51b8c7f8f34f71de8b748bb349ab7d5cd7",
   "text": "Holistische integratie",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_554a898dae8655b30761",
   "sourceHash": "554a898dae8655b307611e7deb46b33ef94c9e03b91c07ccbb9fe2a6a59d494e",
   "text": "Voeding, yoga en behandelingen werken samen als één geheel — niets staat op zichzelf. Uw welzijn wordt integraal benaderd.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_03c9befe03d578963e5a",
   "sourceHash": "03c9befe03d578963e5a97ba88b2700d137c3126a7a45da98e6057e1220b099c",
   "text": "Welzijn op maat",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e5ac06f803adc6225059",
   "sourceHash": "e5ac06f803adc6225059235a1e0f330a186897556f5537b3b9ae263c26ea62cf",
   "text": "5.000 jaar ayurveda, afgestemd op u — beproefde tradities gecombineerd met hedendaags inzicht in welzijn.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d4a4d2c9095d91242235",
   "sourceHash": "d4a4d2c9095d9124223578ab073d127b6fef03af4283f2028742d97fb7ca24c0",
   "text": "Kairali - The Ayurvedic Healing Village & De Kairali-belofte",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9438569ac2b0f6ed856a",
   "sourceHash": "9438569ac2b0f6ed856afa7b85b73d33a46461d21815d7bd142acefac7de2e8c",
